Indicator compatibility
TESTUSDT, 86400 seconds per UTC bar, 2024-01-01 through 2024-01-08 inclusive.
Start with 1000 USDT.
let source = (close / (high - low))
let simple = SMA(close, 2)
let explicit = SMA(close, 2)
let nested = SMA(EMA(close, 2), 2)[1]
let exp = EMA(close, 2)
let recovered = EMA(source, 2)
let points = RSI(close, 2)
let linevalue = MACD(close, 2, 3, 2).line
let linedelay = MACD(close, 2, 3, 2).line[1]
let signalvalue = MACD(close, 2, 3, 2).signal
let hist = MACD(close, 2, 3, 2).histogram
let distance = ATR(2)
let upperband = BBANDS(source, 2, 2).upper
let middleband = BBANDS(source, 2, 2).middle
let lowerband = BBANDS(source, 2, 2).lower
let highest = HIGHEST(volume, 2)
let lowest = LOWEST(source, 2)
let returns = ROC(volume, 2)
let again = ROC(volume, 2)
let hole = ROC(source, 2)
let deviation = STDDEV(source, 2)
let threshold = (RSI(close, 1) > 0.3)
At close, enter when (threshold and (simple > 0)).
At next open, allocate ((1 + returns) * 0.5) of equity including entry fee.
Exit all at the next open after (linevalue crosses below 0).
Stop distance distance (price), sampled at signal and frozen at entry.
Target distance 0.3 (fraction of fill), sampled at signal and frozen at entry.
Warmup index 3. Protection at open precedes signal exits. Stop wins simultaneous intrabar touches. Final holdings marked at close.
Fee 10 bps and adverse slippage 5 bps per side. Buy-and-hold enters at the first executable open.
Dataset d54c2c13d6a12aa4c1d9a12721ae112edad46b99e10c87e55fa4c8fb7890f24d. Gap policy reject. First eligible close 2024-01-05T00:00:00Z, first executable open 2024-01-05T00:00:00Z.
